7. SCIENTIFIC EXPLANATION
============================================================

For every important recipe step, determine WHY it works.

Examples:

    Why is salt added before cooking?

    Why is acid added early or late?

    Why is high heat required?

    Why is low heat preferred?

    Why is fat useful?

    Why does browning improve flavor?

    Why does resting change texture?

    Why does grinding change perception?

    Why does pressure cooking work?

    Why does fermentation improve the ingredient?

Use food science to explain the mechanism.

Do not invent mechanisms.

Separate:

    established science
    strong culinary consensus
    plausible explanation
    uncertain hypothesis


