============================================================

Score candidates using:

    R =

        w1 × ingredient utilization
      + w2 × flavor compatibility
      + w3 × texture compatibility
      + w4 × technical reliability
      + w5 × evidence quality
      + w6 × nutritional value
      + w7 × cultural relevance
      + w8 × accessibility
      + w9 × versatility
      - w10 × unnecessary complexity

Do NOT use one universal weighting.

Adapt the weights to the user's objective.


